## Out of scope (explicitly deferred to keep this shippable and Path B open)

- **Pushing imports / web-UI visibility** — Track B. This plan touches only local session-state files; it does not add `entire/imports/v1` to the push set or link checkpoints to commits.
- **Commit-SHA capture from transcripts** — not available in any importer today (verified: no importer parses a commit id). Track B Path B adds parsing + ref-backend keying; because Task 2 reuses the transcript `SessionID` and never pins `BaseCommit`, that work is additive.
- **`entire attach` changes** — untouched; attach keeps its HEAD-linking behavior for live sessions.
- **Making imported sessions rewindable** — intentionally not done; already blocked by the checkpoint `Imported` flag.

